        "sourceFile": "SDO_READ_DATA.cpp",
        "documentation": "Reads an object of up to 256 bytes from a node by SDO into the byte array DATA; DATALENGTH gives the bytes received. Handshake as SDO_READ4. NETWORK counts from 1; DEVICE is the node ID or its name; TIMEOUT T#0s uses the network SDO timeout.\nExample: read(ENABLE := start, DEVICE := IO_Module, INDEX := 16#1008, SUBINDEX := 0, DATA := bytes);"
      },
