    "displayName": "CANopen",
    "description": "CiA 405 function blocks for the CANopen networks of the project: SDO read and write, NMT, node and bus state, emergency messages, and turning nodes on and off. Address a node by its name or node ID. Blocks for this runtime's CANopen slave: its state, its NMT state, the program's emergencies and the master's writes. Needs OpenPLC Runtime v4 with the canopen plugin."
  },
